<title>USA: Raytheon gets $1.12 bln defense contract.</title>
<headline>Raytheon gets $1.12 bln defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The E-Systems division of Raytheon Co has received a U.S. defense contract with an estimated ceiling total of $1.12 billion, the Pentagon said.</p>
<p>The contract, which includes an initial year and four option years, is for electronics and logistics and maintenance support services for U.S. military special operations forces.</p>
<p>The work would be completed in 2002 if all options are exercised.</p>
